#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:4 feccf92511944b45ba09890d990940c5
msgid "My Imagery & Data Providers"
msgstr "我的图像和数据提供商"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:7 cea8a0fcbbdf4fc688db0cd11c6f9cf0
msgid "In general there are four ways to use aerial or satellite data in Mapflow:"
msgstr "一般来说，在 Mapflow 中使用航空或卫星数据有四种方法："

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:9 7480f839d0824da1a0d97bdd91299912
msgid ""
"**My imagery** – upload your own images to the Mapflow platform and use "
"them for processing with Mapflow models."
msgstr "**我的图像** – 将您自己的图像上传到 Mapflow 平台并使用它们与 Mapflow 模型进行处理。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:10 20f3c42aa59847748972cfd769fbeeeb
msgid ""
"**Imagery basemaps** – external :ref:`imagery providers`, such as Mapbox,"
" ArcGIS, etc., are enabled in Mapflow for instant use. You can use them "
"with default models."
msgstr "**影像底图** – 外部影像提供者，例如 Mapbox、ArcGIS 等，在 Mapflow 中启用以供即时使用。您可以将它们与默认模型一起使用。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:11 260a762a0e9b4f49ab83f3553c962f92
msgid ""
"**Custom URL** – you can set your own XYZ or TMS layers, including "
"commercial ones like :ref:`Nearmap <Nearmap_>`, :ref:`Maxar <Maxar "
"Securewatch>`, etc. This is available in Mapflow Web, API and QGIS "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"**自定义 URL** – 您可以设置自己的 XYZ 或 TMS 图层，包括商业图层，例如 :ref:`Nearmap "
"<Nearmap_>`、:ref:`Maxar <Maxar Securewatch>` 等。这在 Mapflow Web、API 和 QGIS "
"插件中可用。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:12 1f9749d0a3b7438a97085817023f8982
msgid ""
"**Imagery Search** – search for the historical commercial imagery in "
"Mapflow Web and QGIS plugin and place your order to get the images from "
"our partners."
msgstr "**图像搜索** – 在 Mapflow Web 和 QGIS 插件中搜索历史商业图像，并下订单以从我们的合作伙伴处获取图像。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:15 73cd83d3246f49069c968cfca45f7dde
msgid ""
"❗️ You can use the tool called *My imagery* in :ref:`Mapflow Web <My "
"imagery main>`, :ref:`Mapflow QGIS plugin <My imagery qgis>`, and "
":ref:`API <Data API>`."
msgstr ""
"❗️ 您可以在:ref:`Mapflow Web <我的图像主>`、:ref:`Mapflow QGIS 插件 <我的图像 qgis>` "
"和:ref:`API <数据 API>` 中使用名为 *我的图像* 的工具。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:19 766feb25d32a4e4a9b82bd08f9153972
msgid "\"My imagery\" in QGIS"
msgstr "QGIS 中的“我的影像”"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:21 2a0ed33eaac04b7694f3f93b49d8adde
msgid ""
"\"My imagery\" allows you to collect images in separate *Imagery "
"collections*. Using this service, users can easily manage their data "
"collections, reuse images for the next processings and analysis with "
"Mapflow models."
msgstr "“我的图像”允许您在单独的*图像集合*中收集图像。使用此服务，用户可以轻松管理其数据收集，重用图像以使用 Mapflow 模型进行下一步处理和分析。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:33 3cb5980dcf484365a8dd66e3c2acb1b9
msgid "Basic usage:"
msgstr "基本用法："

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:31 d86a3dc7f7ef4fbaadc030d7a231c471
msgid ""
"Processing of multiple images at one time. If you are experiencing the "
"processing of multiple images in one area, this tool will be helpful."
msgstr "一次处理多幅图像。如果您正在经历在一个区域中处理多个图像，那么此工具将会很有帮助。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:32 4e071c10b5dd478c8d5902f774a24722
msgid "Reusing of the uploaded images for the next processings"
msgstr "重用上传的图像进行下一步处理"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:33 61f76a435de740b5930a08f81e156886
msgid ""
"Adding tags to the imagery collections to make them searchable in the "
"Mapflow projects"
msgstr "向图像集合添加标签，使其可在 Mapflow 项目中搜索"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:39 cfed7bca6a4941a3a43a36f1720f81ed
msgid "The basic scenario of working with \"My imagery\" service is as follows:"
msgstr "使用“我的影像”服务的基本场景如下："

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:36 99c8bed4c03049d4bbf9ef6f24bb6b7b
msgid "You are creating an imagery collection (a set of images)"
msgstr "您正在创建图像集合（一组图像）"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:37 d3600a72a61d4ab083f5fb0fd778bd79
msgid "Optionally add tags to identify the collection"
msgstr "可以选择添加标签来识别集合"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:38 cabbd840baba4e04a6064a2816227cdc
msgid "Upload your images to the collection"
msgstr "将您的图像上传到集合中"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:39 a7930f1446714e099fd99372420876dd
msgid ""
"Start processing with Mapflow using the whole Imagery collection or the "
"specific image. With both methods, you can limit the processing area by "
"applying an AOI."
msgstr "使用整个图像集合或特定图像开始使用 Mapflow 进行处理。使用这两种方法，您都可以通过应用 AOI 来限制处理区域。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:42 4306a0c20c3646ce8e6cb3e150cbc603
msgid ""
"Main image upload restrictions and limits are listed in "
":ref:`Requirements for using the platform <Upload restrictions>`."
msgstr "主要图像上传限制和限制列于:ref:`平台使用要求<上传限制>`。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:45 3feb20ae41f84da59b3737cb8b08521e
msgid ""
"Read how to use it in detail in :ref:`Mapflow QGIS plugin <My imagery "
"qgis>`."
msgstr "请参阅:ref:`Mapflow QGIS 插件 <My imagery qgis>` 详细了解如何使用它。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:49 b5be560cb29f433b9797686ea7788e6c
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"My imagery\" Mapflow Web"
msgstr "“我的影像”网站"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:51 56f2ca23e3214debad80620fc1a8fa79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The **My Imagery** page in Mapflow Web lets you manage your imagery "
"collections (*mosaics*): create new collections, upload your own "
"GeoTIFFs, preview them, monitor storage, and start a processing directly "
"from an uploaded image. Open the page from the main menu of the Web app "
"(see the interface overview in :doc:`get_started`)."
msgstr ""
"Mapflow Web 中的 **我的图像** 页面可让您管理图像集合（*马赛克*）：创建新集合、上传您自己的 "
"GeoTIFF、预览它们、监控存储以及直接从上传的图像开始处理。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:53 a49fee9f664f4090b1a9b75c436292c2
msgid ""
"A **mosaic** is a collection of georeferenced images organized for "
"processing and preview. Mosaics are useful when you work with multiple "
"aerial images covering one area."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:56 3377260090b3400fb62b9a7ab0c8f1fc
msgid "Typical workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:58 05b3620fc7b746a5b91c04543255d1a8
#, fuzzy
msgid "The basic scenario of working with \"My imagery\" in Mapflow Web:"
msgstr "使用“我的影像”服务的基本场景如下："

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:60 e3684eddcc2c43ebb576c4fb3ee5de9d
msgid ""
"**Upload your images** – drag GeoTIFF files into the Upload area (or "
"click to browse). If no mosaic is selected in the table, a new mosaic is "
"created automatically and the files are uploaded into it. To upload into "
"an existing mosaic, select it in the list first. You can also create an "
"empty mosaic in advance with **\"+ Create mosaic\"**."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:61 f252d7dcff064bafab98ec18ea322ae6
msgid ""
"**Wait until the images are ready** – each image gets a status: *In "
"progress* while uploading and preprocessing, *Ready* when it can be used,"
" *Failed* if something went wrong."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:62 0b979e2dab3748858249732fb9a2e85b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Start a processing** – click **\"Use in new processing\"** button on "
"the selected mosaic (or image), then pick an existing project or create a"
" new one with **\"+ New project\"**."
msgstr ""
"选择 **在新处理中使用** 将打开一个对话框，您可以在其中选择要在其中开始处理的项目。从列表中选择一个现有项目，或使用 **+ 新项目** "
"创建一个新项目。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:63 25a2d04a15bb4797ac7916c7e93c4af8
msgid ""
"**Set the processing area** – click **\"Use Image Extent\"** to process "
"the entire image. You can also draw an AOI on the map, or upload a "
"GeoJSON file to process a specific part of the image."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:64 c7d5fd113875483b854f644beca21dfd
msgid ""
"Click **\"Save\"** button to continue with the processing settings: "
"choose the AI model, configure its parameters, and run the processing!"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:67 3615056dd1464ba2a1df3ca44c961015
msgid "My Imagery main page"
msgstr "我的影像主页"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:76 63fedfc422b64ebaba1b382f3b3ffa59
msgid "The page consists of the following elements:"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:78 a47fcd8179c24f419638b39b39ad9e4d
msgid ""
"**Storage** – check how much of your storage is used (used / total). When"
" the limit is running out, you can free up space by deleting unused data,"
" or extend your limit by switching to one of the `Premium plans "
"<https://mapflow.ai/pricing>`_."
msgstr ""
"**存储空间** – 检查已使用的存储空间量（已使用/总计）。当限制用完时，您可以通过删除未使用的数据来释放空间，或者通过切换到“高级计划 "
"<https://mapflow.ai/pricing>”之一来延长限制。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:79 1dd79ada64b94cf1b0af2559b30dcf5a
msgid ""
"**Create mosaic** – create a new mosaic (image collection) to group "
"related images together."
msgstr "**创建马赛克** – 创建新的马赛克（图像集合）以将相关图像分组在一起。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:80 a96b56b26b5046ca98fb7cb09612779f
msgid ""
"**Upload area** – drop GeoTIFFs (or click to browse) to upload them into "
"the selected mosaic."
msgstr "**上传区域** – 放置 GeoTIFF（或单击浏览）将其​​上传到选定的马赛克中。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:83 ed1b7943bb0b47beb0a667bfd54fb677
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Requirements for using the platform <Upload restrictions>` for "
"supported formats and limits."
msgstr "请参阅:ref:`使用平台的要求<上传限制>`了解支持的格式和限制。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:85 a7cad2a8fe1c4c299b53a53bfb614b3e
msgid ""
"**Image previews** – browse the table of mosaics and, for the selected "
"mosaic, preview its images along with their status (*Ready*, *In "
"progress*, *Failed*)."
msgstr "**图像预览** – 浏览马赛克表，并针对所选马赛克预览其图像及其状态（*就绪*、*进行中*、*失败*）。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:86 97e64de9a1604c1bab82ff4cdc29ad26
msgid ""
"**Use in new processing** – start a new processing from the selected "
"image."
msgstr "**用于新处理** – 从所选图像开始新处理。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:89 05ab32bf2ffa46db937ad51f88d952a2
msgid ""
"Each mosaic and image has its own status. The table lists all your "
"mosaics, each with a unique UUID, and can be searched by name, and sorted"
" by name, creation date, size, and status."
msgstr "每个马赛克和图像都有自己的状态。该表列出了所有马赛克，每个马赛克都有唯一的 UUID，可以按名称搜索，并按名称、创建日期、大小和状态排序。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:92 faf06dc20387494f93cdba786d29db8a
msgid "Use in new processing"
msgstr "用于新加工"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:94 0b979e2dab3748858249732fb9a2e85b
msgid ""
"Selecting **Use in new processing** opens a dialog where you choose the "
"project to start the processing in. Pick an existing project from the "
"list, or create a new one with **+ New project**."
msgstr ""
"选择 **在新处理中使用** 将打开一个对话框，您可以在其中选择要在其中开始处理的项目。从列表中选择一个现有项目，或使用 **+ 新项目** "
"创建一个新项目。"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:104 21d75fa913734c5e98feceadce48e21f
msgid "Preview and AOI"
msgstr "预览和 AOI"

#: ../userguides/my_imagery.rst:106 d7e0f4f8013a4283a20568f50378953e
msgid ""
"You can preview your image on the map and set the processing area: upload"
" a GeoJSON/GeoTIFF, draw the area on the map, or click **Use Image "
"Extent** to use the image boundaries. See :ref:`Select AOI` for details "
"on drawing and uploading an AOI."
msgstr ""
"您可以在地图上预览图像并设置处理区域：上传 GeoJSON/GeoTIFF，在地图上绘制区域，或单击 **使用图像范围** "
"以使用图像边界。有关绘制和上传 AOI 的详细信息，请参阅选择 AOI。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:4 3615056dd1464ba2a1df3ca44c961015
