msgstr "搜索新图像"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:173 98a8ec541f764f2b97d3f94660b0c648
msgid ""
"The search card shows the label |alert| of the **new image** found. "
"Clicking on an image in the results table will remove the label."
msgstr "搜索卡显示标签 |alert|找到的**新图像**。单击结果表中的图像将删除标签。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:176 ca3c01c5227e4f66ae4a8fce32650058
msgid "**Two key points on viewing results:**"
msgstr "**查看结果的两个关键点：**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:178 3271bc28ec34467fa49a47235de818a6
msgid ""
"When opening the search, you will see **all** results found for the given"
" area(s)"
msgstr "打开搜索时，您将看到给定区域找到的**所有**结果"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:179 9de3151d437b4dfeac3fd5458ace8531
msgid ""
"If your search consists of multiple AOIs and you're interested in "
"specific ones, you can select them in the \"Upload GeoJSON or GeoTIFF "
"file...\" section → Now results will only be displayed for the selected "
"AOIs. Also, you can select/deselect AOI by clicking on the map, the "
"results table will be updated automatically."
msgstr ""
"如果您的搜索由多个 AOI 组成，并且您对特定的 AOI 感兴趣，则可以在“上传 GeoJSON 或 GeoTIFF 文件...”部分中选择它们 "
"→ 现在，将仅显示所选 AOI 的结果。另外，您可以通过单击地图来选择/取消选择 AOI，结果表将自动更新。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:183 a7655735eea54290ba8741f938b9313a
msgid "Processings <> Scheduled Search"
msgstr "处理中 <> 预定搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:185 5fe9d30020534a9b8bb635075ef66728
msgid ""
"Processing is launched in the same way as from :ref:`instant search "
"<imagery-search-web>`:"
msgstr "处理的启动方式与即时搜索 <imagery-search-web>` 相同："

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:187 048497593f9242ec93e0d03b69b30845
msgid "Open a scheduled search"
msgstr "打开预定搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:188 948dad0642f64fe0996be3e155386a2a
msgid "Select the desired image and click \"Save\""
msgstr "选择所需的图像并单击“保存”"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:189 c7bc72e275334c829f1b8642f87f408d
msgid "Select the necessary parameters and start the processing!"
msgstr "选择必要的参数并开始加工！"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:191 8e33fb0c1fb7403ea9d7bbdd75bfc7b9
msgid ""
"All processing launched from a search is linked to it. You can find them "
"in the search's AOI table. Simply select the necessary ones on the map, "
"and they will all be displayed on one map."
msgstr "从搜索启动的所有处理都与其链接。您可以在搜索的 AOI 表中找到它们。只需在地图上选择需要的，它们就会全部显示在一张地图上。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:201 97e64de9a1604c1bab82ff4cdc29ad26
msgid "Some actions you can perform with processing from the search AOI table:"
msgstr "您可以通过搜索 AOI 表中的处理来执行一些操作："

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:203 faf06dc20387494f93cdba786d29db8a
msgid "Open this processing in a new tab"
msgstr "在新选项卡中打开此处理"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:204 e6f7aebee48946b2aed3e16f8b9080b4
msgid "Download processing boundaries"
msgstr "下载处理边界"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:205 ee163050ff9b44c9852b19de95a6e1e3
msgid ""
"Clip the search AOI to the boundary of its processing (\"Stop this area\""
" button)"
msgstr "将搜索 AOI 剪辑到其处理的边界（“停止此区域”按钮）"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:207 e4f16d3844434a90a462f4f0ad98c2bc
msgid ""
"Last one can be useful if you are already satisfied with the processed "
"part of the AOI and do not want to see it in the search results (the "
"trimmed part will no longer be used in the background search)."
msgstr "如果您已经对 AOI 的处理部分感到满意​​并且不想在搜索结果中看到它（修剪后的部分将不再在后台搜索中使用），那么最后一个可能会很有用。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:219 35f067cbb47d4477a822fd077b912c1b
msgid "Main operations with Scheduled Search"
msgstr "预定搜索的主要操作"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:229 44595f0e431e479fa0f4c5912988916b
msgid ""
"**Source details** - Here you can view and download the geometry of your "
"search"
msgstr "**来源详细信息** - 在这里您可以查看和下载搜索的几何形状"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:230 f38415d9759e4dc4babc708b7798b4f9
msgid ""
"**Mark all as seen** - If you have a lot of unread images, you can mark "
"them as viewed all at once"
msgstr "**全部标记为已查看** - 如果您有大量未读图像，您可以将它们一次性标记为已查看"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:231 deabf14d5fe04a0cb3630321feddbaee
msgid ""
"**Set Active Until** - You can change the lifetime of the background "
"search (6 months by default at creation)"
msgstr "**设置活动直到** - 您可以更改后台搜索的生命周期（创建时默认为 6 个月）"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:239 81c5f0c466784940aefa9ce2f7e6df24
msgid "Search Active Until"
msgstr "搜索活动截止时间"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:239 85f695defaab4e86885d6f07461cfeb0
msgid "After expired, the Search will not be deleted, but paused"
msgstr "过期后，搜索不会被删除，而是暂停"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:241 941bac1f40f2445f999eeb11d84e3c4e
msgid ""
"**Pause/Resume Search** - The pause means that it will stop the "
"background search, but you can still view its results"
msgstr "**暂停/恢复搜索** - 暂停意味着它将停止后台搜索，但您仍然可以查看其结果"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:242 027f865cac1d4b6bafa4323b87609f99
msgid "**Delete** - Permanently deletes the search"
msgstr "**删除** - 永久删除搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:245 13db29dbfc734ed980dc25a12e5886a3
msgid "Modifying the AOI search"
msgstr "修改 AOI 搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:247 8f28b2bb414e4c5a90f097e71a5c95ef
msgid ""
"You can add a new AOI to an existing search, modify the geometry, or "
"delete areas that have already been processed. After any AOI changes, you"
" will need to confirm these changes. The search will be updated, and the "
"**results will be synchronized** accordingly."
msgstr "您可以将新的 AOI 添加到现有搜索、修改几何图形或删除已处理的区域。任何 AOI 更改后，您需要确认这些更改。搜索将更新，**结果将相应同步**。"

#: 1129b4c0b5684bc8a76ad6840167c6ae
msgid "Update template"
msgstr "更新模板"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:257 c241052cce9143acbd4e7bab5949593b
