msgstr "**您还可以更改现有搜索的搜索条件：**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:259 fee1c66e693d498dbd306bad3ad65265
msgid ""
"\"View on the map\" → Adjust the search parameters → \"Search Imagery\" →"
" \"Save as schedule\". Now the background search will work according to "
"the new parameters."
msgstr "“在地图上查看”→调整搜索参数→“搜索图像”→“另存为计划”。现在后台搜索将根据新参数进行工作。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:270 5016daaf7f6540eb82459eadf8d3791a
msgid "Using Mapflow Imagery Search in QGIS"
msgstr "在 QGIS 中使用 Mapflow 图像搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:272 e33d3b38b74b4f9d8df1985995135c30
msgid ""
"Switch to the tab \"Imagery Search\". To start the search, set the dates "
"and the product type filters (\"Mosaic\" – Imagery basemaps like ArcGIS "
"or Global mosaic and/or \"Images\" - Satellite imagery archives)"
msgstr ""
"切换到“图像搜索”选项卡。要开始搜索，请设置日期和产品类型过滤器（“马赛克”- 影像底图，如 ArcGIS 或全球马赛克和/或“图像”- "
"卫星影像档案）"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:273 578e2406f0a0468d8b8719eb35aa0d97
msgid ""
"Set additional filters like a minimum intersection with your area of "
"analysis."
msgstr "设置额外的过滤器，例如与分析区域的最小交集。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:274 d545fe160c454c7bb1e23e39ee55f645
msgid ""
"If there is non-empty response, it will add the **🔎 Imagery Search "
"metadata** layer to your QGIS project. You can select one or multiple "
"results in the table - or use the layer's attribute table to start the "
"analysis and processing with Mapflow models."
msgstr ""
"如果有非空响应，它将添加 **🔎 Imagery Search 元数据** 图层到您的 QGIS 项目。您可以在表中选择一个或多个结果 - "
"或使用图层的属性表开始使用 Mapflow 模型进行分析和处理。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:283 79d1bd3f7bca4a5689b2fa0d89eaac35
msgid ""
"In the Arcgis search results you see the zoom level at which the mosaic "
"is available over you area. You can configure the table columns in the "
"Settings."
msgstr "在 Arcgis 搜索结果中，您可以看到您所在区域的马赛克可用的缩放级别。您可以在“设置”中配置表格列。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:293 d667cb236f6e4bf88e7b45915d97406b
msgid ""
"👉 See :ref:`Mapflow <> QGIS` for more information on how to use Imagery "
"Search in Mapflow Web and QGIS plugin."
msgstr "👉 有关如何在 Mapflow Web 和 QGIS 插件中使用图像搜索的更多信息，请参阅:ref:`Mapflow <> QGIS`。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:296 5016daaf7f6540eb82459eadf8d3791a
msgid "Planned Search in QGIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:298 0f8721b25ce5453fb11e95c94944900b
msgid ""
"**Planned Search** is a recurring background search. You define the "
"search area and parameters once, and Mapflow keeps looking for new "
"imagery over that area - you will be notified when new images are found. "
"The search runs in the background, so you can keep working with the "
"plugin in the meantime, review the results at any time and start "
"processing directly from them."
msgstr ""

